	(text "NeoPixel output (spec 5.2). Strip power is +5V (not OUT): WS2812 strips are 5 V parts.\nBudget about 1-2 A from the on-board buck (30-50 LEDs at full white); inject power separately beyond that.\nGPIO34 drives the strip through a 5 V buffer; the solder holes tap GPIO34 (before the buffer) and GPIO35."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cfd4ce28-e157-4526-b13c-ef7459c01272")
	)
